# AgriInsights UK — deployment repo
#
# This repo holds ONLY the files the app needs to run. Everything below is either
# machine noise or something that must never leave the development machine.

# ── Internal documents ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The working repo carries a handover, market and residue reviews, and a folder of
# notes covering pricing, the investor material and every defect found and fixed.
# None of it belongs in a deployment repo, and this one is public. Listed by name
# so that copying the whole working folder across cannot publish them by accident.
HANDOVER.md
CONTENTS.md
*-REVIEW.md
*-review.md
_claude-memory/
.claude/
docs/
reviews/

# ── Anything carrying real farm or bank data ─────────────────────────────────
# Statements belong to third parties: their account numbers and their transactions.
# The bank import work is tested with synthetic fixtures only, and its scratch
# directory is _work. Nothing of that shape should ever be committed here.
tools/bank-harness/_work/
_work/
*.csv
*.ofx
*.qif
*.qbo
*.xls
*.xlsx

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The app's Supabase config lives in ai-data-uk.js and is deliberately tracked, but
# it must only ever hold the PUBLISHABLE key. A service role key belongs in an env
# file, and an env file belongs nowhere near a public repo.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json

# ── macOS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.AppleDouble

# ── Editors ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
